mcp-python-chart - notes on the packaging
=========================================

The staged build
----------------

As the one of 'mcp-python-container' - see 'debian-container/README.source'.
The stage - 'build/deb-chart/mcp-python-chart-<version>', made by 'make
package-deb' of 'chart/Makefile' ('make chart-package-deb' at the root):

 * 'debian' - a copy of this directory, the symbolic links replaced by the
   files.

 * 'chart' - a copy of the directory 'chart' of the source tree.

 * '<chart name>-<version>.tgz' - the chart, of 'make package' there.

The changelog is kept by hand; its version is the one of 'debian/changelog'
- the build stops otherwise ('deb-version-check' of 'chart/Makefile').

The launcher
------------

'mcp-python-chart' takes the secrets code of 'mcp-python-container'
('mcp-python-container-launcher.bash') and its image - so the dependency on
that package, of the same version: the chart deploys the image of the same
build. The chart name in the launcher is filled in at the staging
('@CHART_NAME@'); in the source tree it stays, and the launcher takes the
chart directory next to it.

The chart and its values are in '/usr/share/mcp-python-chart' - the chart
is architecture independent ('Architecture: all').
